ndEntry 把真实 prompt/model/settings/discovery 写进父子 transcript；verify 复用既有 D8 schema 和 activeBranch，判定工具+真实 Program21→42 CallReport、实际 named worker/definition/model/return、skill URI正文、五产品规则注入、child none 覆盖。测试工具不进入 runtime customization workspace，不复制产品正文、不注册替代工具、不使用 hash 验收。\n\n## 变更预演（Layer 1）\n\n本 PR 不做基础设施 apply。A0 driver 仍由测试者拥有；其唯一新增阶段是 real installer 后的显式 prepare argv，并从 campaign config 写 build.json。driver 保留 clean gate、凭据、PTY、脱敏和清理。\n\n## 落地核对（Layer 2）\n\n完整实现已提交 ff15d97；bun run --cwd e2e check 通过；python3 scripts/build-release.py --output /tmp/soroi-dist02-release 已实际产出含验收工具的 tar。这些只是辅助结果，不代替 runtime。observer 源文件未打包 host singleton，prepare/verify 才编译为普通 Bun CLI。\n\n## 启动与行为（Layer 3 / 4）\n\n当前尚未完成本 PR 的真实 runtime 验收。将使用本 PR 的实际 CI 下载 tar，与 https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/issues/235 的 driver owner 合用一次完整真实 A0；空 HOME gate 必须在 A0 专属 token/配置注入之前。不会用 marker、root-only calls[]、本地重建或旧 PR234 证据冒称本次 verifier 通过。所有五谓词和最终清理结果到位后整体替换本节并归档真实原始记录。\n\n前置发行 https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/239 与设置 https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/234 已合并并有独立 runtime 证据；本 PR 不重开它们或修改 role/skill/rule 内容。","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-01T03:42:07Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T05:16:09Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c05de99fc98fbb9155da01cb585064323b8bfb4c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Pepgent:eng/install-check-224","ref":"eng/install-check-224","repo":{"id":1366237810,"node_id":"R_kgDOUW8icg","name":"soroi","full_name":"Pepgent/soroi","owner":{"login":"Pepgent","id":327843718,"node_id":"O_kgDOE4p_hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327843718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent","html_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent